{"id":"u26","kelas":9,"no":8,"judul":"Persiapan Ujian","title":"Exam Review","emoji":"🎓","ringkas":"Rangkuman dan latihan campuran","ready":true,"goals":["mengingat kembali semua **tense** yang sudah dipelajari dari Kelas 7 sampai 9","membedakan **jenis teks**: narrative, recount, procedure, descriptive, report, announcement, invitation, letter","mengenal pola soal ujian dan strategi menjawabnya","mengerjakan **latihan campuran** dari seluruh materi"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Selamat, ini unit terakhir! Di **Unit 8 Kelas 9** kamu **mengulang semuanya**: tense, jenis teks, dan tips mengerjakan soal ujian. Baca rangkuman di bawah dengan santai, lalu kerjakan Latihan dan Kuis campuran."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Rangkuman tense","table":[["Tense","Rumus","Contoh","Dipakai untuk"],["**Simple present**","V1 (he/she/it + s/es)","[[She plays football.]]","kebiasaan, fakta"],["**Present continuous**","am/is/are + V-ing","[[She is playing football now.]]","sedang terjadi"],["**Simple past**","V2 / was / were","[[She played football yesterday.]]","selesai di masa lalu"],["**Past continuous**","was/were + V-ing","[[She was playing when I came.]]","sedang berlangsung di masa lalu"],["**Present perfect**","have/has + V3","[[She has played football for years.]]","pengalaman, sampai sekarang"],["**Future (will)**","will + V1","[[She will play tomorrow.]]","keputusan, janji, dugaan"],["**Be going to**","am/is/are going to + V1","[[She is going to play tomorrow.]]","rencana"]]},{"t":"tip","title":"Cara memilih tense","text":"Cari **kata petunjuk waktu**: *every day, usually* (simple present); *now, at the moment* (present continuous); *yesterday, last week, ago* (simple past); *while, when* (past continuous); *ever, never, already, yet, for, since* (present perfect); *tomorrow, next week* (future)."},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Rangkuman jenis teks","table":[["Jenis teks","Tujuan","Struktur","Ciri bahasa"],["**Recount**","menceritakan pengalaman","Orientation, Events, Re-orientation","simple past, kata urutan"],["**Narrative**","menghibur dengan cerita","Orientation, Complication, Resolution","simple past, past continuous"],["**Procedure**","menjelaskan cara membuat sesuatu","Goal, Materials, Steps","kalimat perintah, kata urutan"],["**Descriptive**","mendeskripsikan satu hal","Identification, Description","simple present, adjective, has/have"],["**Report**","menyampaikan fakta umum","General Classification, Description","simple present, subjek jamak"],["**Announcement**","memberi informasi","what, when, where, who, contact","will be held, must, please"],["**Invitation**","mengundang","greeting, acara, tanggal, jam, tempat","Would you like to ...?"],["**Letter / email**","berkomunikasi","greeting, opening, body, closing, name","bahasa sopan atau santai"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"3. Daftar cepat grammar penting","table":[["Topik","Ingat"],["**to be**","I am, he/she/it is, you/we/they are; lampau was/were"],["**do / does**","negatif dan pertanyaan simple present; setelahnya kata kerja dasar"],["**did**","negatif dan pertanyaan simple past; setelahnya kata kerja dasar"],["**modal**","can, must, should, may, will + kata kerja dasar (tanpa to dan tanpa -s)"],["**comparative/superlative**","taller than, the tallest; more beautiful, the most beautiful"],["**conditional 1**","If + simple present, will + kata kerja dasar"],["**passive**","to be + past participle (is made, was built)"],["**some / any**","some = positif/tawaran; any = negatif/pertanyaan"],["**at / on / in**","at + jam; on + hari/tanggal; in + bulan/tahun"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. Strategi mengerjakan soal ujian","text":"1. **Baca soal dua kali** dan garis bawahi kata kuncinya (when, who, how many).\n2. **Baca teks dulu** (jika ada), lalu cari jawaban dengan kata kunci.\n3. **Coret pilihan yang jelas salah**, lalu pilih yang paling tepat dari sisanya.\n4. Untuk soal grammar, **cari kata petunjuk waktu** (yesterday, now, for, since).\n5. **Jangan terlalu lama** pada satu soal; tandai dan kembali nanti.\n6. **Periksa kembali** jawaban sebelum mengumpulkan."},{"t":"tip","title":"Perkaya kosakata setiap hari","text":"Dengarkan lagu atau video berbahasa Inggris, tulis 5 kata baru per hari, dan coba pakai dalam kalimat. Klik kata berwarna di unit sebelumnya untuk melatih pelafalan."},{"t":"summary","items":["Tense: pilih berdasarkan **kata petunjuk waktu**.","Teks: kenali **tujuan** dan **struktur** masing-masing.","Modal dan did/does: kata kerja kembali ke **bentuk dasar**.","Terus berlatih: kosakata, membaca, dan berbicara sedikit setiap hari. 🎉"]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan jenis teks dengan tujuannya:","pairs":[["Recount","menceritakan pengalaman"],["Procedure","menjelaskan cara"],["Report","menyampaikan fakta umum"],["Narrative","menghibur dengan cerita"],["Descriptive","mendeskripsikan satu hal"]],"exp":"Setiap teks punya tujuan.","k":"4896aa23"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kata petunjuk waktu dengan tense:","pairs":[["every day","simple present"],["at the moment","present continuous"],["yesterday","simple past"],["for three years","present perfect"],["tomorrow (rencana)","be going to"]],"exp":"Kata petunjuk waktu menentukan tense.","k":"35d91a09"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["She go to school every day.","She goes to school every day.","She going to school every day.","She gone to school every day."],"answer":1,"exp":"every day + she → goes.","k":"cde6b431"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["I am study now.","I studying now.","I am studying now.","I studied now."],"answer":2,"exp":"now → am studying.","k":"7534440c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["I didn't went to school.","I didn't go to school.","I not went to school.","I wasn't go to school."],"answer":1,"exp":"didn't + kata kerja dasar.","k":"a3e45e60"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["She has lived here since five years.","She has lived here for five years.","She lives here since five years.","She living here for five years."],"answer":1,"exp":"for + durasi.","k":"3961c7f2"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["If it will rain, we stay home.","If it rains, we will stay home.","If it rain, we will stay home.","If it rains, we stay will home."],"answer":1,"exp":"If + simple present, will + V1.","k":"bd7c92b4"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["This cake is made by my mother.","This cake makes by my mother.","This cake is make by my mother.","This cake is making by my mother."],"answer":0,"exp":"Pasif: is + made.","k":"d8440e98"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["Rani is more taller than Dina.","Rani is taller than Dina.","Rani is tallest than Dina.","Rani is most tall than Dina."],"answer":1,"exp":"taller than.","k":"8b195b3a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["You must to wear a helmet.","You must wear a helmet.","You musts wear a helmet.","You must wearing a helmet."],"answer":1,"exp":"must + kata kerja dasar.","k":"26c10b12"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mereka sedang menonton TV sekarang.","q":"They ___ watching TV now.","answers":["are"],"hint":"is / are ?","exp":"They + are + kata kerja-ing.","k":"77ea834a"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia pergi ke Bali tahun lalu.","q":"She ___ to Bali last year. (go)","answers":["went"],"hint":"go → ...","exp":"last year → went.","k":"1820cfb0"},{"type":"fill","id":"Aku belum pernah makan durian.","q":"I have ___ eaten durian.","answers":["never"],"hint":"n _ _ _ _","exp":"never = tidak pernah.","k":"5e74975b"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Ada banyak buku di perpustakaan.\"","answer":"There are many books in the library.","exp":"There are + banyak + tempat.","k":"38fbff40"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Tense apa ini?","say":"She was reading when I called her","options":["Past continuous dan simple past","Simple present","Future","Present perfect"],"answer":0,"exp":"was reading (berlangsung) + called (memotong).","k":"a5e2711c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Teks yang memiliki struktur Goal, Materials, dan Steps adalah...","options":["Procedure text","Report text","Narrative text","Recount text"],"answer":0,"exp":"Procedure.","k":"b4f83132"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan tense dengan rumusnya:","pairs":[["simple past","V2 / was / were"],["present perfect","have/has + V3"],["past continuous","was/were + V-ing"],["passive (present)","am/is/are + V3"],["be going to","am/is/are going to + V1"]],"exp":"Rumus tense.","k":"22bf3b9d"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan jenis teks dengan contohnya:","pairs":[["Recount","My Holiday in Bali"],["Procedure","How to Make Iced Tea"],["Report","Komodo Dragons"],["Announcement","English Speech Contest"],["Invitation","Dear Rani, please come to my party"]],"exp":"Jenis teks.","k":"b194e333"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kata dengan fungsinya:","pairs":[["must","kewajiban"],["should","saran"],["may","izin"],["will","keputusan atau janji"],["can","kemampuan"]],"exp":"Modal verb.","k":"e558cb41"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["She has lived here since 2020.","She lives here since 2020.","She has live here since 2020.","She is living here since 2020."],"answer":0,"exp":"since + present perfect.","k":"8d28ca4e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["The cake was made by my mother.","The cake made by my mother.","The cake is making by my mother.","The cake was make by my mother."],"answer":0,"exp":"Pasif lampau.","k":"72df78a6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["If you study, you will pass.","If you will study, you pass.","If you studied, you will pass.","If you studying, you will pass."],"answer":0,"exp":"Conditional 1.","k":"baa8b3c3"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["I was cooking when she called.","I cooking when she called.","I were cooking when she called.","I was cook when she called."],"answer":0,"exp":"Past continuous + simple past.","k":"e4378747"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["Rani is the tallest girl in class.","Rani is tallest girl in class.","Rani is the most tall girl in class.","Rani is taller girl in class."],"answer":0,"exp":"Superlative.","k":"8d5458c5"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["There are many students in the hall.","There is many students in the hall.","There are many student in the hall.","There be many students in the hall."],"answer":0,"exp":"There are + jamak.","k":"c2c282b3"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["I'd like a glass of orange juice.","I'd like a glass orange juice.","I'd like glass of an orange juice.","I like a glass of orange juice please now."],"answer":0,"exp":"I'd like + a glass of ...","k":"332c796b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Teks yang menjelaskan fakta umum tentang hewan disebut...","options":["report text","recount text","invitation","letter"],"answer":0,"exp":"Report text.","k":"9332c0f7"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Teks yang berisi Goal, Materials, Steps disebut...","options":["procedure text","narrative text","descriptive text","announcement"],"answer":0,"exp":"Procedure text.","k":"bee4cc31"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Teks yang menceritakan kejadian dengan masalah dan penyelesaian disebut...","options":["narrative text","report text","procedure text","invitation"],"answer":0,"exp":"Narrative text.","k":"20fb8e27"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia sudah pergi ke Bali tiga kali.","q":"He ___ been to Bali three times.","answers":["has"],"hint":"have / has ?","exp":"He → has.","k":"db6316a0"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kami tinggal di rumah kemarin.","q":"We ___ at home yesterday. (stay)","answers":["stayed"],"hint":"stay + ed","exp":"stayed.","k":"7cadf0d1"},{"type":"fill","id":"Jika kamu belajar, kamu akan lulus.","q":"If you study, you ___ pass.","answers":["will"],"hint":"will","exp":"will.","k":"965acb53"},{"type":"fill","id":"Buku ini ditulis oleh guruku.","q":"This book was ___ by my teacher. (write)","answers":["written"],"hint":"write → ...","exp":"written.","k":"23087301"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia lebih tinggi daripada aku.","q":"She is ___ than me. (tall)","answers":["taller"],"hint":"tall + er","exp":"taller.","k":"048687a1"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Aku tidak melihat dia kemarin.\"","answer":"I didn't see him yesterday.","exp":"didn't + kata kerja dasar.","k":"10d4cf76"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Dia sedang membaca buku sekarang.\"","answer":"She is reading a book now.","exp":"is + kata kerja-ing.","k":"3fa5105c"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun pertanyaan: \"Apakah kamu pernah ke Yogyakarta?\"","answer":"Have you ever been to Yogyakarta?","exp":"Have + you + ever + been + to ...?","k":"573e543e"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Tense apa ini?","say":"I have lived here for five years","options":["Present perfect","Simple past","Simple present","Future"],"answer":0,"exp":"have lived + for.","k":"6ebdb843"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"You mustn't run in the corridor","options":["Dilarang berlari di koridor","Sebaiknya berlari di koridor","Harus berlari di koridor","Boleh berlari di koridor"],"answer":0,"exp":"mustn't = dilarang.","k":"53ad85db"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"Last Sunday, my family went to the zoo. We saw elephants, monkeys, and tigers. We ate lunch there. I was very happy.\" Teks ini termasuk jenis...","options":["Recount","Procedure","Report","Announcement"],"answer":0,"exp":"Pengalaman = recount.","k":"4c7d5c21"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"Tigers are big cats. They live in forests. They eat meat. They are good hunters.\" Teks ini termasuk jenis...","options":["Report","Narrative","Recount","Invitation"],"answer":0,"exp":"fakta umum.","k":"013bcbaa"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"Pour hot water into a glass. Add a tea bag. Wait for three minutes. Add some sugar.\" Teks ini termasuk jenis...","options":["Procedure","Narrative","Descriptive","Letter"],"answer":0,"exp":"langkah.","k":"6c8ba11e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"My cat is Mimi. She is white and small. She has green eyes.\" Teks ini termasuk jenis...","options":["Descriptive","Procedure","Report","Recount"],"answer":0,"exp":"satu hal tertentu.","k":"8de409d8"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"Dear Rani, Would you like to come to my party on Saturday? Best wishes, Dina\" Teks ini termasuk jenis...","options":["Invitation","Report","Procedure","Narrative"],"answer":0,"exp":"undangan.","k":"7bdd4652"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca dialog: A: \"Have you ever been to Bali?\" B: \"___\"","options":["Yes, I have. I went there last year.","Yes, I did ever.","No, I will.","Yes, I am."],"answer":0,"exp":"present perfect + simple past.","k":"8887698b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca dialog: A: \"What will you do if it rains?\" B: \"___\"","options":["I will stay at home.","I stayed at home.","I am staying home tomorrow.","I stay at homes."],"answer":0,"exp":"conditional.","k":"68417f04"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["She goes to school yesterday.","She went to school yesterday.","She goes to school every day.","She is going to school now."],"answer":0,"exp":"yesterday → went.","k":"a378488c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["The book was write by him.","The book was written by him.","The book is written by him.","He wrote the book."],"answer":0,"exp":"was written.","k":"92dac9a8"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["I have been to Bali last year.","I went to Bali last year.","I have been to Bali.","I have never been to Bali."],"answer":0,"exp":"last year → simple past.","k":"4a06254a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["This is the most easy question.","This is the easiest question.","This question is easier than that.","This question is easy."],"answer":0,"exp":"easiest.","k":"f5a352e0"},{"type":"fill","id":"Aku sedang makan siang sekarang.","q":"I am ___ lunch now. (have)","answers":["having"],"hint":"hav + ing","exp":"having.","k":"5ac815d8"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia membeli tas baru kemarin.","q":"She ___ a new bag yesterday. (buy)","answers":["bought"],"hint":"b _ _ _ _ _","exp":"bought.","k":"4415ae26"},{"type":"fill","id":"Jika kamu belajar, kamu akan berhasil.","q":"If you study, you ___ succeed.","answers":["will"],"hint":"will","exp":"will.","k":"6ca9caa4"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia lebih tinggi daripada aku.","q":"He is ___ than me. (tall)","answers":["taller"],"hint":"taller","exp":"taller.","k":"a272a1e5"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Kami akan mengunjungi nenek besok.\"","answer":"We are going to visit our grandmother tomorrow.","exp":"are going to visit.","k":"16325cfb"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Dia sedang membaca ketika aku masuk.\"","answer":"She was reading when I came in.","exp":"was reading + came.","k":"16040c5f"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Jenis teks apa?","say":"First wash the vegetables Then cut them into small pieces","options":["Procedure","Report","Narrative","Invitation"],"answer":0,"exp":"langkah-langkah.","k":"1589ed4a"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Tense apa?","say":"She has lived here since two thousand twenty","options":["Present perfect","Simple past","Future","Past continuous"],"answer":0,"exp":"has lived since.","k":"d5889f00"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Situasi: Kamu menulis tentang liburanmu minggu lalu. Jenis teks dan tense yang tepat adalah...","options":["Recount, simple past","Report, simple past","Procedure, past continuous","Narrative, future"],"answer":0,"exp":"recount.","k":"4c4846a6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Situasi: Kamu menulis cara membuat es teh. Jenis teks dan bentuk kalimatnya adalah...","options":["Procedure, kalimat perintah","Recount, simple past","Report, simple present","Narrative, past continuous"],"answer":0,"exp":"procedure.","k":"15d2f0ac"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana ejaan yang benar?","options":["announcement","anouncement","annoucement","announcment"],"answer":0,"exp":"announcement.","k":"02b9d753"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana ejaan yang benar?","options":["comparative","comparitive","compartive","comperative"],"answer":0,"exp":"comparative.","k":"2870ea89"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana ejaan yang benar?","options":["conditional","condisional","conditonal","kondisional"],"answer":0,"exp":"conditional.","k":"473f9564"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata tanya yang tepat: \"___ did you go last holiday?\"","options":["Where","Who is","How old","What time is"],"answer":0,"exp":"Where.","k":"ded7aeab"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata tanya yang tepat: \"___ have you studied English?\" (Tiga tahun.)","options":["How long","Who","Where","How many is"],"answer":0,"exp":"How long.","k":"efde8267"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata tanya yang tepat: \"___ will you do if it rains?\"","options":["What","Who is","How old","Where is"],"answer":0,"exp":"What.","k":"fe63980b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata yang tepat: \"She ___ English for two years.\"","options":["has studied","studied yesterday","is studying yesterday","studies yesterday"],"answer":0,"exp":"present perfect.","k":"993f2895"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata yang tepat: \"The temple ___ built in the ninth century.\"","options":["was","is","were","has"],"answer":0,"exp":"was built.","k":"c9201663"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata yang tepat: \"You ___ wear a helmet.\" (wajib)","options":["must","mustn't","don't have","may not"],"answer":0,"exp":"must.","k":"8e0add83"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata yang tepat: \"We were eating ___ the lights went out.\"","options":["when","if","unless","so"],"answer":0,"exp":"when.","k":"7131b414"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia tinggal di sini sejak 2019.","q":"She has lived here ___ 2019.","answers":["since"],"hint":"s _ _ _ _","exp":"since.","k":"e8f77536"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tas ini dibuat di Bandung.","q":"This bag is ___ in Bandung. (make)","answers":["made"],"hint":"m _ _ _","exp":"made.","k":"dd4a686b"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Kami pergi ke pantai tahun lalu.\"","answer":"We went to the beach last year.","exp":"went